{"seq":2,"slug":"pipeline","title":"管道","docCount":3,"url":"/h/devops-tools/log-engineering/pipeline","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"collection-agents-shipping","title":"采集代理与传输","url":"/h/devops-tools/log-engineering/pipeline/collection-agents-shipping","wordCount":1434,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"elk-loki-clickhouse","title":"ELK、Loki 与 ClickHouse","url":"/h/devops-tools/log-engineering/pipeline/elk-loki-clickhouse","wordCount":1504,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"log-parsing-enrichment","title":"日志解析与富化","url":"/h/devops-tools/log-engineering/pipeline/log-parsing-enrichment","wordCount":1350,"readingTime":6}],"introMarkdown":"# 管道\n\n日志管道是连接\"日志产生\"与\"日志消费\"的工程中枢。本章覆盖三个关键阶段：采集代理如何可靠地将日志从数千个源头运送到中央存储、三大主流存储后端（ELK、Loki、ClickHouse）的架构选型与适用场景、以及日志在落盘前如何通过解析与富化获得查询价值。管道的设计质量直接决定了下游分析与告警的时效性和准确性。\n"}